# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored "build/" also matches the real
# src/fncre/build/ package (build-identity verification), which must stay
# tracked. This previously caused git to silently drop that package from
# every commit — see docs/legacy-compatibility.md's Phase 3 follow-up note.
/build/
/dist/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
